共に幸せをつかむ。\n\nイラストは、あなたの判断を信じます。薔薇をテーマに、舞踏会からインスピレーションを得たイラストです。このイラストは、舞踏会をイメージしたバラをモチーフにしています。\n\nこんな感じでいいでしょうか、ありがとうございました。", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@world__te/works/46", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 765082, "client_id": 1788839, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c5a93818/uploads/origins/77e50826-6c08-4dbc-b551-6da0a6481500?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4bd66c2ae4d34d915ac4c6fad06696cc", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c5a93818/uploads/origins/77e50826-6c08-4dbc-b551-6da0a6481500?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8a2d0812330cf4eefc3e1e0c4b06f430", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello , I love your pastel works and would like a cute loving piece of me and my wife. \nDedako is a dark skinned frog girl with a symbol on her head and long green hair, she likes strawberries and pastel lilac & green. \nplease use her new outfit in the references. \nBearamisu is a owlbear who lives fantasy aesthetic, reading , cooking and lilac green.\nplease make a loving piece with pastel aesthetic with a similar pose to the ref.\n\nI really like this piece you have done in the past. \nhttps://skeb.jp/@world__te/works/39\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1QvFe8Eit-e00YwMT9Qb7jc9OA1MKQ3iv?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@world__te/works/45", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 765082, "client_id": 2017661, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/479fd67f/uploads/origins/86fff38c-2cb8-48b8-9b16-4367cf903e45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompres